ALIGNMENT

Alignment describes your character's moral code. You choose one of the
seven Palladium alignments at character creation. It is shown on score
and is not changed in play except through staff intervention.

  Principled     - see help principled
  Scrupulous     - see help scrupulous
  Unprincipled   - see help unprincipled
  Anarchist      - see help anarchist
  Miscreant      - see help miscreant
  Aberrant       - see help aberrant
  Diabolic       - see help diabolic

Principled and Scrupulous are good. Unprincipled and Anarchist are
selfish. Miscreant, Aberrant, and Diabolic are evil.

